        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/b782af/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-27T07:02:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Stuff like this can make you hope the environment helps you/hinders the villains. That being said, sometimes the heroes are just up a creek with no paddles to be had...</p><p>Does anyone have any preferred heroes/strategies when it comes to taking on Dawn? I'll take any advice, but I'm currently restricted to the core set (Rook City is coming in next week, but that's all I've got).</p>",
