      {
        "id": 56379,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-27T07:06:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's usually good to take Visionary because she can A) Destroy Dawn's pesky ongoings, B) Use Suggestion to get Citizens out of the trash and postpone Dawn flipping and C) Manipulate the villain deck a little. Wraith can also be a good choice since Infrared Eyepiece can help you avoid Devastating Auroras or any other nasty cards. It might also be good to take a character who can deal decent damage to multiple targets like Tempest, Haka, or Bunker.</p>",
