        "created_at": "2013-03-27T21:38:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Of course, sometimes you look at the top two cards of her deck and they're <span class=\"bbcode-i\">both</span> Devastating Auroras. Then it's even worse becuase you <span class=\"bbcode-i\">know</span> all your stuff is about to get nuked but there's bugger all you can do about it. Yes, this has happened in one of our games :P.</p>",
